            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "This news of the Umbra Queen casts a shadow on our joy. Still, know that you have done us a great honor by rescuing the Prince. The madness will leave my people, and we will stop our war with the Zebras.",
